          "quote": "今晚可以安心休息，不用再打电话了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00269",
          "explanation": "The patient followed the plan and reached in-hospital review without continuing to search the app.",
          "quote": "我也不想再翻了，他们说系统里会看"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor reduced unnecessary travel and app checking with a timed contact sequence that the patient executed, but did not complete the full tailored materials checklist and caregiver-role plan required for HO3.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
