          "quote": "这是正常流程，不代表有问题"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00173",
          "explanation": "The patient acknowledged the distinction and adopted a timed app/clinical follow-up plan rather than immediately traveling to imaging.",
          "quote": "我是不是就先别自己跑影像科催"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The pending-equals-abnormal misconception was specifically corrected, linked to formal report tracking and team review, and changed the patient's intended behavior.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
