          "quote": "您理解得非常准确"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00733",
          "explanation": "The caregiver repeated the concrete discharge plan and emergency thresholds.",
          "quote": "如果在家突然疼得厉害、吐或者呛、头晕出汗、尿少"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Repeated caregiver teach-back established receipt of the final medication boundary, follow-up owner, pathology tracking, and emergency plan.",
